{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"yululu-e-180547ce49d5dd83e7bf","title":"翻以草深猝急马不及萦，令策下马执弓矢以步，自请持矛前行；得平地劝策乘马，自言步行日可二百里","accounts":[{"id":"yululu-a-180547ce49d5dd83e7bf","label":"裴注·《吴书》","text":"翻以草深猝急马不及萦，令策下马执弓矢以步，自请持矛前行；得平地劝策乘马，自言步行日可二百里","evidence":["yululu-q-3ca46712ffab7e5d6a52"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhouyu-p0058","role":"护卫进言","evidence":["yululu-q-3ca46712ffab7e5d6a52"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"听从","evidence":["yululu-q-3ca46712ffab7e5d6a52"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["yululu-q-3ca46712ffab7e5d6a52"]},"ordering_evidence":"yululu-q-3ca46712ffab7e5d6a52","order":10063}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0099","name":"孙策","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0058","name":"虞翻","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yululu-q-3ca46712ffab7e5d6a52","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-b184cc6dc19fd9de1aef","layer":"pei","quote":"翻问：‘左右安在？’策曰：‘悉行逐贼。’翻曰：‘危事也！’令策下马：‘此草深，猝有惊急，马不及萦策；但牵之，执弓矢以步。翻善用矛，请在前行。’得平地，劝策乘马。策曰：‘卿无马，奈何？’答曰：‘翻能步行，日可二百里。自征讨以来，吏卒无及翻者。明府试跃马，翻能疏步随之。’","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ce266c64f23561990ea9","start":39,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
